OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 1 APR
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from Newcastle Cathedral for
OL,6,     Gthe Wednesday in Holy Week, with
OL,7,     Gmusic by Gesualdo, Eriks
OL,8,     GEsenvalds, Dvorak and Dupre.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,10,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,11,     GHildegard becomes a leader and
OL,12,     Gstrikes out on her own. With
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod.
OL,14,G1700FIn Tune
OL,15,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,16,     Gfrom pianist Libby Burgess,
OL,17,     Gcellist Cara Berridge and
OL,18,     Gviolinist Sophie Rosa. Katie also
OL,19,     Ginterviews the directors of the
OL,20,     Gnew QueerScore festival.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
