OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 1 APR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GAlina Ibragimova is the soloist
OL,9,     Gin Bartok's Violin Concerto No.
OL,10,     G1, and Edward Gardner conducts
OL,11,     Gthe London Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,12,     Gin Mussorgsky's Pictures at an
OL,13,     GExhibition.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: The Lives of Hildegard
OL,15,     Fof Bingen
OL,16,     GMedieval composer and polymath
OL,17,     GHildegard of Bingen navigates
OL,18,     Gchallenges as a prioress. A
OL,19,     Gfictionalised account, written by
OL,20,     GAnna Linstrum and performed by
OL,21,     GJuliet Stevenson.
